  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"wohPl\" id=\"wohPl\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4220b21\" id=\"uc4220b21\">配置断言输出</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u59e7fcce\" id=\"u59e7fcce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b5dd2fe\" id=\"u9b5dd2fe\">在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u48f17a24\" id=\"u48f17a24\"><span data-lake-id=\"u09c07676\" id=\"u09c07676\">FreeRTOSConfig.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf7078e66\" id=\"uf7078e66\">中注释掉原来的</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubd9c9073\" id=\"ubd9c9073\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ef42bef\" id=\"u8ef42bef\">configASSERT</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5c52a6d1\" id=\"u5c52a6d1\">代码，并声明如下内容：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22FreeRTOSConfig%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F*%20%E6%96%AD%E8%A8%80%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87printf%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20*%2F%5Cn%23define%20vAssertCalled(char%2C%20int)%20printf(%5C%22Error%3A%20%25s%2C%20%25d%5C%5Cr%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20char%2C%20int)%5Cn%23define%20configASSERT(%20x%20)%20if(%20(%20x%20)%20%3D%3D%200%20)%20vAssertCalled(%20__FILE__%2C%20__LINE__%20)%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%2F%2F%23define%20configASSERT(%20x%20)%20if(%20(%20x%20)%20%3D%3D%200%20)%20%7B%20taskDISABLE_INTERRUPTS()%3B%20for(%20%3B%3B%20)%3B%20%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%23define%20configASSERT(%20x%20)%200%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22FreeRTOSConfig%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fndlf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2c8113c5\" id=\"u2c8113c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9259faf\" id=\"ud9259faf\">则可以在串口中得到报错时的文件及所在行</span></p>",
